    "question": "belongsToMany relationship kya hoti hai aur pivot table kaise kaam karti hai?",
    "explanation": "belongsToMany many-to-many relationship handle karta hai jisme ek intermediate 'pivot' table hoti hai jo dono tables ke IDs store karti hai. Pivot table mein extra data bhi rakh sakte hain.",
    "example": "Ek Employee multiple Roles rakh sakta hai aur ek Role multiple Employees ko assign ho sakta hai - ye employee_role pivot table se manage hota hai.",
    "code": "class Employee extends Model {\n    public function roles() {\n        return $this->belongsToMany(Role::class)\n            ->withPivot('assigned_at')\n            ->withTimestamps();\n    }\n}\n\n$employee->roles()->attach($roleId, ['assigned_at' => now()]);",
