    "interviewAnswer": "belongsToMany handles many-to-many relationships using a pivot table that stores foreign keys from both related tables. Laravel provides methods like attach(), detach(), and sync() to manage these relationships, and withPivot() allows accessing additional columns stored on the pivot table itself.",
