    "question": "Eloquent Accessors kya hote hain aur inhe kaise define karte hain?",
    "explanation": "Accessors database se data retrieve karte waqt uski value ko transform/format karte hain, bina actual database value change kiye. Modern Laravel mein Attribute class use hoti hai.",
