    "topic": "Queues",
    "question": "Laravel Queues kya hain aur inhe kab use karna chahiye?",
    "explanation": "Queues time-consuming tasks (emails, reports, image processing) ko background mein defer karte hain taaki user ko turant response mile, aur heavy kaam alag worker process handle kare.",
    "example": "Bulk invoice PDF generate karke email karna 1000 customers ko - ye kaam queue jobs ke through background mein process hota hai, request timeout nahi hota.",
    "code": "// config/queue.php - driver: redis/database\nphp artisan queue:table && php artisan migrate\nphp artisan queue:work",
